{"t":"LAES","made":"2026-11-24 14:32","name":"SEALSQ Corp","ko":"실SQ","sector":"Technology","industry":"Semiconductors","employees":185,"hq":"Cointrin, Switzerland","website":"https://www.sealsq.com","summary_en":"SEALSQ Corp, together with its subsidiaries, designs, develops, and markets semiconductors in North America, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, the Asia Pacific, and Latin America. It offers semiconductors, such as VaultIC secure elements, quantum-resistant RISC-V secure chips, secure ARM platform, and smart card reader chips; custom chip design services; and other PKI services, including personal digital identity services. The company also provides semiconductors secure chips, SaaS, software and INeS certificate management platform, implementation, integration and other services, and ASIC design and production services. Additionally, it develops WISeRobot.ch, a platform human and artificial intelligence collaboration. It serves smart energy, smart home, automotive EV charging, consumer IoT, aerospace and military telecommunications, industry, logistics, medical, and luxury sectors. It has a strategic partnership with L5 Cartronics to develop secure multi-package IoT modules for smart cameras and smart metering. The company was founded in 2022 and is headquartered in Cointrin, Switzerland. SEALSQ Corp operates as a subsidiary of WISeKey International Holding AG.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"SEALSQ Corp는 자회사와 함께 북미, 유럽, 중동, 아프리카, 아시아 태평양 및 라틴 아메리카에서 반도체를 설계, 개발 및 판매합니다. VaultIC 보안 요소, 양자 저항성 RISC-V 보안 칩, 보안 ARM 플랫폼 및 스마트 카드 리더 칩과 같은 반도체를 제공합니다. 맞춤형 칩 설계 서비스; 개인 디지털 신원 서비스를 포함한 기타 PKI 서비스. 이 회사는 또한 반도체 보안 칩, SaaS, 소프트웨어 및 INeS 인증서 관리 플랫폼, 구현, 통합 및 기타 서비스, ASIC 설계 및 생산 서비스를 제공합니다. 또한 인간과 인공지능의 협업 플랫폼인 WISeRobot.ch를 개발합니다. 스마트 에너지, 스마트 홈, 자동차 EV 충전, 소비자 IoT, 항공우주 및 군사 통신, 산업, 물류, 의료 및 럭셔리 부문에 서비스를 제공합니다. L5 Cartronics와 전략적 파트너십을 맺고 스마트 카메라 및 스마트 미터링을 위한 보안 멀티 패키지 IoT 모듈을 개발하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 2022년에 설립되었으며 스위스 코인트린에 본사를 두고 있습니다. SEALSQ Corp은 WISeKey International Holding AG의 자회사로 운영됩니다.","val":{"price":1.015,"mcap":228304512.0,"pe":null,"fpe":-3.759259,"peg":null,"ps":9.288979,"pb":0.42256454,"ev_ebitda":5.063,"div":0.0,"beta":-7.122,"hi52":5.48,"lo52":0.955},"fin":{"rev":24578000.0,"rev_g":1.311,"eps_g":null,"gross":0.52616,"op":-2.06502,"net":-1.7038001,"roe":-0.123339996,"fcf":-32420000.0,"cash":482278016.0,"debt":7140000.0,"de":1.27,"eps":-0.2,"feps":-0.27},"own":{"short":0.0287,"inst":0.07582,"insider":0.03794},"analyst":{"n":2,"mean":5.875,"median":5.875,"high":8.0,"low":3.75,"rec":"none","recMean":null,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":1,"buy":1,"hold":0,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":1,"buy":1,"hold":0,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-04-02","Firm":"Cantor Fitzgerald","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":4.0,"priorPriceTarget":7.0},{"GradeDate":"2025-12-18","Firm":"Cantor Fitzgerald","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"","Action":"init","priceTargetAction":"Announces","currentPriceTarget":7.0,"priorPriceTarget":0.0},{"GradeDate":"2025-02-05","Firm":"Maxim Group","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":6.0,"priorPriceTarget":1.75},{"GradeDate":"2024-09-27","Firm":"Maxim Group","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":1.75,"priorPriceTarget":2.25}],"earn":{"next":"2026-09-11","eps_avg":null,"eps_low":null,"eps_high":null,"rev_avg":null,"eps_est":[{"period":"0q","avg":null,"low":null,"high":null,"yearAgoEps":null,"numberOfAnalysts":null,"growth":null,"currency":"USD","methodology":"normalized"},{"period":"+1q","avg":null,"low":null,"high":null,"yearAgoEps":null,"numberOfAnalysts":null,"growth":null,"currency":"USD","methodology":"normalized"},{"period":"0y","avg":-0.24,"low":-0.24,"high":-0.24,"yearAgoEps":-0.24,"numberOfAnalysts":1.0,"growth":0.0,"currenc